        <Text>
            <GUID>3072</GUID>
            <Text>Les premiers renforts arrivent [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName], on croit que la ville peut rapidement devenir une destination populaire pour les soldats qui sont prêts à se battre pour leur pays.</Text>            <!-- As first visitors arrive in [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName], there is belief that town can quickly become a popular destination for tours and excursions, and that its many features and amenities can have a lasting appeal. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
